  "input": "Which note recorded the handover of the ledger to Ember, and on what date?\n[2025-11-13] handover/2025-11-13-ledger: The ledger has a new home: team Ember. Team Atlas kept it until today. [2025-07-04] handover/2025-07-04-webhooks-correction: Fixing an error in the 2025-06-20 handover: the new owner of the webhooks service is Dune. Ember was recorded by mistake and never held it. [2025-03-31] handover/2025-03-31-auth-gateway: Ownership change: the auth gateway now sits with the Boreal team. Team Ember no longer owns it.",
